Description: Supports the teaching and learning of user experience (UX)
    evaluation. Provides functions for usability metrics (task success, task
    time, error rate and the System Usability Scale), for summarising
    usability studies and for simulating reproducible synthetic UX data, with
    teaching datasets, case studies and a workbook. The System Usability Scale
    follows Brooke (1996, ISBN:9780748404605). Learning materials are licensed
    CC BY 4.0.
URL: https://pablosancheznunez.com/uxlearn/, https://github.com/pablosancheznunez/uxlearn
